View, update, and manage persistent Orbit CLI configuration (~/.config/orbit/config.yaml).
Supports hierarchical resolution with environment variables and command-line flags.

Usage:
  orbit config [command]

Available Commands:
  get         Get configuration value for a key
  init        Initialize default configuration file
  list        List all resolved configuration entries and their sources
  path        Print path to the configuration file
  set         Set a configuration key-value pair
  show        Display current configuration with secrets masked
  unset       Unset a configuration key

Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to configuration file
  -h, --help            help for config

Use "orbit config [command] --help" for more information about a command.
